{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "main_10_level_main_10-04_beg",
  "groupId": "main_10",
  "stageId": "main_10-04",
  "title": "城市的呼吸",
  "storyCode": "10-5",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "../../vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_10-04_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "9fec6f681ca7ed5f7f1399f0532059c18d358be5845507f1f405a9d8b010c650",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "管道。幽深的，一眼望不到頭的管道。\n這些管道連通了整座城市。它們是倫蒂尼姆的血管，源源不斷地將能量輸送至倫蒂尼姆的心臟，也就是我們所在的位置。\n不要畏懼你眼前的黑暗。太陽在每個傍晚落下，而陰影會在城市的脈管中永生。\n當光明被奪走，你需要更信任你的雙耳、你的鼻腔、你的其餘感官。\n請仔細聆聽吧。機械轟鳴即是血液奔湧，齒輪轉動應和呼吸節律。\n是的，倫蒂尼姆是活著的。無論我們在不在那高高的座椅上，它都有著自己的生命力。\n如果有一天，你又一次來到這裡......無論那時在背後追逐著你的是什麼，你都無需感到害怕。\n因為你奔跑在倫蒂尼姆的身體裡。\n維娜，你回家了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "27_g7_subway"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好了，各位，我們可以先在這裡停一停。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃，這是什麼怪地方？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們從上面一路爬下來，好像鑽進了一個什麼管道......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "路是寬敞了不少，可是好黑呀......\n嗚哇！你不會是想把我們拐到什麼廢棄工地，然後殺人滅口吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......哈？咳咳，也許，你說得沒錯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂，你小子到底什麼來頭？別以為我們真的會聽你擺佈！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......保險起見，這個問題我需要先問問你們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們到底是什麼人？為什麼想要混進倫蒂尼姆？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......在我們做出任何回答之前，請你放開我們的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "是啊，我還在你手裡呢。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "快把我放了。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這兜帽朋友是你們的指揮官？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒錯，我看到是誰在戰鬥中發號施令了。但是卡特斯小姐，你才是那個帶隊的人，對吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別露出這麼驚訝的眼神。你們是藏了幾手，可我們是......是本地人，這套玩得比你們熟得多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "本地人......你們是倫蒂尼姆的居民？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "剛才那場混戰，你們也有參與？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別猜。卡特斯小姐，我們彼此還不夠信任。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只是和深池還有薩卡茲動了下武，並不能說明什麼。他們之間也常常打架，這並不意味著我們應當和他們某一方交朋友。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......倫蒂尼姆的血管。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你......你說什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們已經來到倫蒂尼姆城內了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你怎麼知道？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......這些通道。它們內外連通，能讓我們繞開薩卡茲的守衛，直接從牆外抵達城內。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們走了多久？二十分鐘？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我想，我們正處在倫蒂尼姆薩迪恩區的某一項關鍵設施的地下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這設施離高牆不算遠。而且，它是一個樞紐，從這裡出發，能去很多地方......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......鐵軌。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "再往前一到兩公里，我們頭頂就是車站。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你對倫蒂尼姆很熟悉。你也在這裡生活過？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "本地人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "難怪。我早就想說了，你的錘子讓我特別有親切感，菲林女士......呃，你是菲林吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你們是什麼，我就是什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，要是你們真是薩卡茲派來的間諜，我是不是該後悔了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不要傷害博士——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "他傷害不了我。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "後悔也晚了。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......呃？！你......你什麼時候把無人機控制住了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "竟、竟然徒手捏在手裡！你不怕我手裡有遙控器，直接引爆無人機上的炸彈？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "你沒有遙控器。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "這無人機是個只會飛的半成品。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哇，這下糟了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你什麼時候發現的？在我和你們說話的時候，還是在帶你們進地下通道的時候？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還是說更早......等等，你真的......在我抓住你的時候，就已經知道這無人機沒有威脅了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那你還任由我拉著你走來走去？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "我要評估下你的意圖。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "你以為我的同伴沒看出來嗎？",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......假如你真表現出了傷害博士的意圖，在你的手碰到遙控器之前，我的錘子會先到你跟前。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我說你呀，你要是抓一個傻一點的，比如我旁邊這個只會打拳的，搞不好還真能讓她上當哦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你說什麼？你真以為他能靠近我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊......這麼說，我偷偷準備好的無線電干擾器派不上用場了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——“本地人”先生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我想，這場互相試探的鬧劇是時候結束了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "敵人的炮火雖然沒法追到這裡，可我們面臨的共同威脅並未遠去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "請問我們是否已經展現了足夠的誠意？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "從剛見面開始，我們有無數機會對你動手。即便我們真的是薩卡茲的間諜，眼下也已經摸清楚了大致的方向，沒有必要再與你多費口舌。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博士之所以能忍耐著扮演人質的角色，我們之所以願意隨你走入這地下通道，都是因為我們願意相信你沒有惡意。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "相應地，你是不是也可以再多信任我們一些，告訴我們你的真實意圖？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，這些話聽起來很有說服力。畢竟，眼下我也算你們的人質了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "洛洛，出來吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_4040_rockr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "無、無無無人機......？這麼多？！這陣勢是把我們都瞄準了？我們豈不是......豈不是隨時都可能被射成馬蜂窩？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "洛洛，別費勁指著他們了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不管他們有沒有發現你和無人機，以他們的實力，真打起來的話，我可是壓根沒有逃命的機會啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_4040_rockr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "心裡有數的話，下回就別拉上我玩這無聊的遊戲了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好吧，你說得對。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，兜帽朋友，你能把洛克十七也還給我嗎？對，就你手裡那個無人機......我剛做了一半，你真捏壞了它，洛洛會生氣的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呼......現在，我們該重新認識一下了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我叫費斯特，這位是洛洛，我的搭檔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們隸屬於......倫蒂尼姆市民自救軍。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "27_g4_giantwall"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你覺得，在倫蒂尼姆這座城市裡，有多少我們看不見的角落？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......無法計數。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "幾百上千的老工廠，四成已經廢棄，六成還在使用。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還在使用的那些多半是建在更老的工廠舊址上，每一處廠房都像一個裝滿了數百年工業垃圾的迷宮。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一座又一座廠房中間，填塞著更多貧民窟。就連城防軍高層都說不出來，這些民用工業區和老物流區到底有多少人口。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有時候，我會覺得這裡和我們的卡茲戴爾並沒有多少區別。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他們只是多造了一層光鮮的外殼，好把那些腐臭的部分埋得更深一些，以免熏到了那些體面的大人物。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......想在三天之內從卡茲戴爾貧民窟裡抓出一群鬧事的人，難度無異於單槍匹馬打劫一支有教宗騎士坐鎮的拉特蘭使節團。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那還是建立在我們都出生在卡茲戴爾的基礎上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "倫蒂尼姆......誰敢說自己熟悉倫蒂尼姆？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們擊潰議會的衛隊，拿下七成倫蒂尼姆城防軍的控制權，花了多久？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不到一周。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們吊死了幾個領頭反對的貴族，數十次打退他們花錢雇來的烏合之眾，直到把他們管得服服貼貼，又花了多久？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一個半月。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可我們在薩迪恩區，和那群自詡反抗軍的人在大街小巷裡來回拉鋸，已經過去好幾個月。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "半年時間，我們幾乎控制住了倫蒂尼姆的其他全部區塊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唯獨這裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一塊半廢棄的民用工業用地，從南到北，環繞倫蒂尼姆中心的山體，連通著無人問津的老物流區......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“倫蒂尼姆的歷史由此發源。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "每一本史書上都會這麼寫。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我知道諸王之中，有一位或者幾位對我至今的戰果很不滿意。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你說過。他們一直想徹底封鎖這塊城區。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他們太容易被激怒。一旦指揮權落到他們手裡，他們就會用倫蒂尼姆人的屍體在薩迪恩區與其他區塊之間築起高牆。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "至少攝政王支援你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，赫德雷，是我要盡全力支持將軍。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "王庭總是不理解將軍的苦心......他們並不理解眼前的平衡是多麼脆弱。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你知道我為何堅持暫時只啟動城防副炮嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "倘若我現在就啟動主炮......城外的大公爵會不會一齊向城內邁步？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "倘若我們真的大肆屠殺倫蒂尼姆平民，城內的貴族與投向我們的城防軍，會不會再起異心，與我們鱗死網破？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "倘若我們徹底放棄這塊工業區，沒了每天用列車送往碎片大廈的材料，將軍的計畫又要被迫延遲多久？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "諸王的驕傲不容許他們低下古老的頭顱，來多看一眼這異邦的都城。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在我看來，想徹底掌控倫蒂尼姆，最難打的仗就在眼前。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "27_g7_subway"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "薩卡茲會叫我們反抗軍，我們對這個稱謂也沒什麼意見。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果只有站出來反抗他們才能救我們自己的話，那最普通的倫蒂尼姆人都會拿起武器。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你知道倫蒂尼姆其他區塊的情況如何嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不會比這裡更好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所有人，要嘛為薩卡茲工作，要嘛丟掉性命。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "陸陸續續有消息從北邊傳過來，我只聽說那裡的薩卡茲軍隊手段比這裡的還狠。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "維娜，留下來的貝爾德她們豈不是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別著急。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我怎麼能不急！五年，我們走了五年，我都不知道她們是不是已經......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我們會找到她們的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "很快，我們會把她們一個個找回來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好，維娜，我相信你。不管她們在哪裡，不管她們是生是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉！我不在你面前說喪氣話！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "女士們，只要你們的朋友還活著，我們總有辦法聯繫上她們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們......不光在薩迪恩區活動？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們可以在倫蒂尼姆的任何地方，甚至城外。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他們每抓走我們中的一個，就會有十個人站出來加入我們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "洛洛是土生土長的薩迪恩區人，她是我們的元老成員之一，她最清楚，我們的隊伍是怎樣一點點壯大的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_4040_rockr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......連你都當上小隊長了，我看人員增長速度是有點快。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈，是誰帶你打了十一場勝仗啊，副隊長？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_4040_rockr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只是到處把人救到地下，這也算勝仗嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "能在薩卡茲眼皮子底下搶回一條命，保留一些暗地裡活動的機會......不就是勝利？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們都瞧見了，薩卡茲還沒有徹底掌控薩迪恩區。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這裡的地形與人流都足夠亂，如果薩卡茲想掌握地上地下的每一塊能讓人呼吸的空間，他們得用自己的雙腳丈量個好幾年。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而且......這裡也是最後一支倫蒂尼姆城防軍的隊伍與薩卡茲作戰的地方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "達格達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_396_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看樣子他們也輸了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，真打輸了也就輸了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那場戰鬥結束得很快......有點太快了。在所有人反應過來之前，薩卡茲就已經站在了城牆上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "達格達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_396_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "全都是因為那幫叛徒！他們蛀空了我們的精銳部隊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "女士，你曾經是軍隊的人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "達格達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_396_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "達格達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_396_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，我不算是。我只是......呃，和她們一樣的本地人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好吧，本地人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們都知道軍隊內部確實有叛徒，數量還不少。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "叛徒們和部分貴族率領著大部分城防軍一起投向了薩卡茲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "除了薩迪恩區，在大街小巷上巡邏的依然可能是“倫蒂尼姆城防軍”。只是他們的長官，已經成了薩卡茲宴會上的常客。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "達格達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_396_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那在附近作戰的最後一支隊伍......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他們堅持到了最後，每一個士兵都付出了慘痛的代價。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不清楚他們之中有多少還活著......但是我想，經歷了那樣無望的戰鬥之後，每看一眼如今倫蒂尼姆的高牆，他們都會很痛苦吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "27_g9_lightinduarea_street_d"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerId": "avg_4039_horn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不必這麼警惕。抬起頭，把手從弩上鬆開，姿勢稍微放鬆一些。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "倫蒂尼姆市民？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_413_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咳，咳咳。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerId": "avg_4039_horn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "附近的居民習慣了各式各樣的人從這裡經過。他們並不會幫我們，但只要不是性命受到威脅，他們也絕不會聽命於深池和薩卡茲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "倫蒂尼姆市民？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_413_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在這些敵人眼皮底下生活......恐怕很不容易。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerId": "avg_4039_horn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你知道他們以前是怎麼看待我們的嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "倫蒂尼姆市民？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_413_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃，我沒有想過。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerId": "avg_4039_horn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我以前也不會去想。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "倫蒂尼姆市民？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_413_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "中尉......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerId": "avg_4039_horn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對了，在外面不要叫我中尉。還是叫號角吧，這地方屬於不同部隊的“中尉”數量過多了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "倫蒂尼姆市民？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_413_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是，號角。我們要去哪裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerId": "avg_4039_horn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們先去和其他同伴會合。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerId": "avg_4039_horn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "薩卡茲的巡邏隊會在五分鐘後路過這一帶。我們分成兩隊，先後沿著前面的鐵軌往東走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerId": "avg_4039_horn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "三百五十米之後，你們會看到一截往上走的鐵皮樓梯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerId": "avg_4039_horn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要是聽到五下金屬敲擊聲，你們就可以跟上來。三下，原地等待。兩下，立刻解散。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerId": "avg_4039_horn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也許你會覺得那一片廢棄廠區很眼熟......別太驚訝，那裡也是深池的駐地。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "倫蒂尼姆市民？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_413_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這......豈不是會很危險？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerId": "avg_4039_horn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有深池在，至少薩卡茲很少來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerId": "avg_4039_horn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "想不想試試看捉迷藏？歡迎加入這場遊戲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "27_g7_subway"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我說，你們真的只是一家普通企業？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "和你是一名機械工程師一樣貨真價實。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈......言簡意賅。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "既然薩卡茲都能當倫蒂尼姆的頭兒，我又有什麼理由懷疑你們的說辭呢？醫療企業的安保人員，對吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我看看......一支十七個人的小隊，攜帶著軍用級的裝備，加上不錯的戰術配合，甚至還有著挺像那麼回事的無人機。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......“像那麼回事”？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什麼叫“像那麼回事”？這評價簡直太不像話了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸欸，別生氣呀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "剛剛在上面沒看清楚，要不你什麼時候再給我多看兩眼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......都被薩卡茲炸毀了啊！這麼一想簡直更心疼了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不試著修一修嗎？你一定留了幾架殘骸吧，要不然我幫你看看，我有全套工具。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可露希爾，我剛剛的確搶下來兩架......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "]"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "無人機是羅德島的技術。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "費斯特",
              "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "看來我得拿好東西來換？"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "得先合作，再技術交流。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "費斯特",
              "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "哇，這麼警惕？"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博士......你到底是什麼領域的博士啊？算了算了，有機會再說吧，反正我不著急。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "比起這個，你們到底是怎麼來到倫蒂尼姆的？我跟你們說了不少城內的情況了，看在雙向合作的份上，說說外面的情況吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......這條路有點長。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我知道，你們已經和深池交過手了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們在城外也有眼線？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "卡特斯小姐，我們說好了，情報需要交換。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "按時間遠近倒過來說的話，在倫蒂尼姆外面的附屬地塊，我們與深池之間確實發生了一場戰鬥......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
